---
import Layout from '@layouts/default.astro';

const title = 'About the author';
const description = 'Matei Bumb on how Jesus set him free from addiction, rage and a smiling Christian mask, and why he started Call to Reset.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1 class="page-title">About the author</h1>
  <div class="lesson-prose page-prose about-story">
    <img class="about-photo" src="/images/matei.webp" alt="Matei Bumb" width="220" height="220" />
    <h2>Where I was</h2>
    <p>I wasn't always free. I was lost in a lot of addictions: smoking, alcohol and porn. Underneath it all I carried depression, anxiety and loneliness, and I was always full of rage. And through all of it I kept a smiling Christian face on, so nobody really saw what was going on inside.</p>
    <h2>The night everything changed</h2>
    <p>One night, desperate in my room, I prayed the most honest prayer I had. "Jesus, if You actually exist, help me. I can't do this anymore." In that moment it felt like rivers of love were hitting me and washing me clean. I was set free from all of it. I was a new person.</p>
    <h2>Layer by layer</h2>
    <p>Freedom was a bit like peeling an onion. Many layers came off right away that night. The rest came off over time, as I learned to renew my mind with the truth and let God take each layer away.</p>
    <h2>Where I am today</h2>
    <p>Today I serve with my wife alongside Christ for all Nations around the world, and we're both being trained in their School of Ministry. We've been living by faith, and God has never disappointed us.</p>
    <h2>Why Call to Reset</h2>
    <p>So why Call to Reset? Because everybody deserves the freedom I received. Jesus said, "You will know the truth, and the truth will set you free" (John 8:32). This site is my way of putting that truth in front of you, and of putting my gifts to work in God's vineyard. If you're stuck right now, the same Jesus who met me in my room is ready to meet you too.</p>
  </div>
  <style>
        .about-story > h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
    .about-photo { display: block; width: 220px; height: 220px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 12px; border: 0; box-shadow: none; margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .about-photo { float: left; margin: 0.35rem 1.75rem 1rem 0; }
      .about-story::after { content: ''; display: block; clear: both; }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
